A DIRECT-THREADED 6502 FORTH.  THE KERNEL,
THE TWO GRAPHICS DRIVERS, THE DISK II
DRIVER AND THE FLOATING POINT GLUE ARE
ASSEMBLY.  THE CATALOG, THE FILE COMMANDS
AND THE REST ARE WRITTEN IN FORTH AND
COMPILED AT BOOT FROM SYSTEM.FTH, WHICH
IS ON THIS DISK.

THERE IS NO DOS HERE.  THE BOOT SECTOR ON
TRACK 0 IS OURS, AND SO IS EVERY SECTOR
READ AFTER IT.  THE DISK FORMAT IS DOS
3.3 SO THAT OTHER TOOLS CAN READ IT.

THE FLOATING POINT IS APPLESOFT'S, CALLED
RATHER THAN REWRITTEN.  THE MONITOR IS
WOZNIAK'S, AND STILL DOING THE WORK.
